In Thrash of the Titans!, was confirmed to be the current Champion of the Unova League, indicating that Alder no longer holds the title.

In The Fiery Road to Mastership!, Alder was shown watching Iris's Masters Eight Tournament match against Cynthia. During said match, Iris mentioned her having finished the battle that made her Champion, likely indicating she defeated Alder to earn her title.

